[00:06.631]A hopeless romantic all my life
{"一生都是个无可救药的浪漫主义者"}
[00:10.350]Surrounded by couples all the time
{"身边总是成双成对"}
[00:13.725]I guess I should take it as a sign
{"我想我该把这当作某种预兆"}
[00:17.429](Oh, why oh why? Oh, why oh why?)
[00:19.182]I'm feeling lonely (Lonely)
{"我感到如此孤独（孤独）"}
[00:20.989]Oh, I wish I'd find a lover that could hold me (Hold me)
{"多希望能遇到拥抱我的恋人（拥抱我）"}
[00:24.410]Now I'm crying in my room
{"此刻在房间里独自哭泣"}
[00:26.380]So skeptical of love
{"对爱情充满怀疑"}
[00:28.148](Say what you say, but I want it)
{"（说你想说的 但我就要这样）"}
[00:29.038]But still, I want it more, more, more!
{"但我依然渴望更多 更多 更多！"}
[00:31.778]I gave a second chance to Cupid
{"我给丘比特第二次机会"}
[00:35.048]But now, I'm left here feeling stupid
{"现在却像个傻子呆立原地"}
[00:38.764]Oh, the way he makes me feel that love isn't real
{"他让我感觉爱情如此虚幻"}
[00:42.772]Cupid is so dumb
{"丘比特真是愚蠢"}
[00:47.202]I look for his arrows every day
{"每天寻找他射出的箭"}
[00:50.553]I guess he got lost or flew away
{"或许他迷了路或已飞远"}
[00:53.216]Waiting around is a waste (Waste)
{"空等只是浪费时间（浪费）"}
[00:54.898]Been counting the days since November
{"从十一月起就在数日子"}
[00:56.462]Is loving as good as they say?
{"爱情真如传说中美好吗？"}
[00:59.376]Now I'm so lonely (Lonely)
{"此刻我如此孤独（孤独）"}
[01:01.176]Oh, I wish I'd find a lover that could hold me (Hold me)
