[01:11.938]I gave a second chance to Cupid
{"我又给了丘比特一次机会"}
[01:15.091]But now, I'm left here feeling stupid
{"如今却只觉得自己愚蠢可悲"}
[01:18.743]Oh, the way he makes me feel that love isn't real
{"他让我感觉爱情不过是场虚伪"}
[01:22.783]Cupid is so dumb
{"丘比特实在愚昧"}
[01:36.351](Cupid is so dumb…)
{"（丘比特真蠢…）"}
[01:39.841]Hopeless girl is seeking
{"绝望的女孩仍在寻觅"}
[01:43.108]Someone who will share this feeling
